<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30557" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχειρ-ίδιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the hand</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκετῶν κλάδοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			 (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχειρ-ίδιον</span></b> , τό,
				<i>hand-knife, dagger</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.12
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				214
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.70
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχειριδίῳ πλήττειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					4.6
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>handle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>manual, handbook</i>, title of works by <i><span class="en">
				Epict.
			</span></i> and others, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.Lac.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1013.12
			</span></i> F., <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				2.1.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				<u>Proll.Heph.</u>
				p.86
			</span></i> C. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>tool, implement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				20.25
			</span></i>. [-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐδιον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				46
			</span></i>.]</div>
